8:["$","p","p-2",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"核心目标：实现可重复读 (Repeatable Read)"}]}]
9:["$","p","p-3",{"children":["在 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"REPEATABLE READ"}]," 隔离级别下，数据库承诺在一个事务内，对同一条件的多次查询将返回完全相同的结果集。如果不存在 Gap 锁，并发的 INSERT 操作会破坏这一承诺，导致幻读 (Phantom Read)。"]}]
a:["$","p","p-4",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"幻读场景示例 (无 Gap 锁的情况下)"}]}]
b:["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["T1: ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SELECT * FROM t WHERE id < 25;"}]," 返回 5 条记录。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["T2: ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"INSERT INTO t(id) VALUES (15);"}]," 并提交。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["T1: 再次执行 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SELECT * FROM t WHERE id <25;"}],"，此时将返回 6 条记录。事务 T1 内的查询结果集发生了变化，违反了可重复读的原则。"]}],"\n"]}]
