14:["$","ul","ul-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"范围查询"}],"：执行 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SELECT ... FOR UPDATE"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SELECT ... LOCK IN SHARE MODE"}],"、",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"UPDATE"}],"、",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"DELETE"}]," 时，若 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"WHERE"}]," 条件是范围扫描（如 ",["$","code","code-5",{"className":"$undefined","children":">"}],"、",["$","code","code-6",{"className":"$undefined","children":"<"}],"、",["$","code","code-7",{"className":"$undefined","children":"BETWEEN"}],"），会锁定扫描过的索引区间。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"唯一索引等值查询未命中"}],"：当使用唯一索引（包括主键）进行等值查询，但该记录",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"不存在"}],"时，为防止并发插入该值，InnoDB 会在对应位置加上 Gap 锁。"]}],"\n"]}]
15:["$","p","p-11",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["在 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"READ COMMITTED"}]," 隔离级别下"]}],"："]}]
16:["$","ul","ul-3",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["该级别下默认",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"禁用"}]," Gap 锁，因此大大减少了阻塞概率。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"但在外键约束检查和唯一性检查这两种特殊场景下，为了保证数据一致性，仍然可能会产生 Gap 锁。"}],"\n"]}]
